{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Hall_Highlights.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/gameply_banner.png?t=1743081580\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forsaken Scarecrow</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Twisted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shadow of Pro Nobis</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The First Creation</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/enemy_showcase.png?t=1743081580\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/creatures.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your safe place, and the halfway point between levels. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the look of the lanterns and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special relics throughout the levels, which unlock unique lantern visuals with new animations and new narrative introductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/relic_interaction.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604520?t=1743081580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/d599c9815a99ac22fbc448560d5aec881e6e49fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743081580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/d91451fd70ebbb81b3d5938782bec5e79681cd56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743081580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/d91451fd70ebbb81b3d5938782bec5e79681cd56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743081580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/Hall_Highlights.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/gameply_banner.png?t=1743081580\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forsaken Scarecrow</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Twisted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shadow of Pro Nobis</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The First Creation</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/enemy_showcase.png?t=1743081580\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/creatures.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is your safe place, and the halfway point between levels. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the look of the lanterns and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special relics throughout the levels, which unlock unique lantern visuals with new animations and new narrative introductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/relic_interaction.gif?t=1743081580\" /></p>","developers":["OutZoom"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/ac83277f853b4d08868cb2cd0240fd09ec36782f/header.jpg?t=1743081580","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Re